{"501400": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Knight Versus Demon", "steam_appid": 501400, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KVD has one developer and the gameplay shown is from a prototype showcasing the direction the flow of combat will go: fast-paced 1v1 ground and air combat with different weapons, skills, and powerups for both players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/501400/extras/8d341064ed24579ccb7caeb756036a18.poster.avif?t=1765925568\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/501400/extras/8d341064ed24579ccb7caeb756036a18.webm?t=1765925568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/501400/extras/8d341064ed24579ccb7caeb756036a18.mp4?t=1765925568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A frantic struggle between good and evil springs to life in <i>Knight Versus Demon</i> when a <strong>VR player</strong> takes on the role of a villain going up against the hero: a <strong>local player</strong> using a controller or keyboard / mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Villain [VR]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The villain has a variety of ways to defeat the hero - these include using hands to <strong>slash</strong>, fingers to <strong>impale</strong>, a mouth to <strong>burn</strong>, and eyes to <strong>melt</strong> the shiniest armor any human might equip.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Hero [PC]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" 